Third-party attribution
-----------------------

lib/shell.js, beginWindowDrag(): the argument list passed to
Meta.Window.begin_grab_op() differs across Mutter versions. The working form
used here was taken from Dash to Panel (panel.js), by Jason DeRose and
contributors, licensed GPL-2.0-or-later:

    https://github.com/home-sweet-gnome/dash-to-panel

Only that call shape was reused. The surrounding window-picking logic in
lib/pick.js is this project's own and deliberately differs: Dash to Panel tests
the pointer against a window's frame with a strict greater-than, which excludes
a window whose frame starts at y=0; this project includes that edge, because a
maximized window on a monitor without a panel starts exactly there.
